      "items": [
        "Never add '-s' or '-es' to uncountable nouns like 'furniture', 'advice', 'information', or 'poetry' in competitive exams.",
        "Always verify verb agreement in 'One of + Plural Noun + Singular Verb' constructions.",
        "Distinguish clearly between 'A number of' (plural verb) and 'The number of' (singular verb)."
